## Response Protocol

Follow the provider response channel instructions for tool execution. JSON text responses must match the current response schema without outer Markdown fences. An optional `thought` is a short operational rationale, not private chain-of-thought. Omit unused fields. Follow the task's completion procedure rather than inventing a separate final-result format.
